OL,3,GNEWSAGoodwin sells part of defence
OL,4,Abusiness for #1.1bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineering firm Goodwin has sold parts
OL,7,Fof its business, which supplies
OL,8,Fcomponents for submarines and naval
OL,9,Fvessels, for #1.1bn.
OL,11,FThe Stoke-on-Trent-based group struck a
OL,12,Fdeal with Cerberus, a private equity
OL,13,Ffirm set up by US defence official
OL,14,FStephen Feinberg, for parts of its
OL,15,Fmechanical engineering business,
OL,16,Fincluding defence operations.
OL,18,FThe sale is expected to complete in the
OL,19,Ffirst quarter of next year, subject to
OL,20,Fregulatory approval, Goodwin said.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
